{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24247","headline":"夜宴醉後留献裴侍中 · 白居易","name":"夜宴醉後留献裴侍中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九烛台前十二姝，主人留醉任欢娱。\n翩翻舞袖双飞蝶，宛转歌声一索珠。\n坐久欲醒还酩酊，夜深初散又踟蹰。\n南山宾客东山妓，此会人间曾有无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}